### ─── AUTH: Register, Login, Refresh, Logout ─────────────────────────

### Requiere http-client.env.json en http/ o en la raíz del proyecto
### Variables: Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
###
### USUARIOS PRE-SEMILLADOS (password: password123):
###   admin@cursinet.com      → Admin
###   instructor@cursinet.com  → Instructor
###   moderator@cursinet.com   → Moderator
###   student@cursinet.com     → Student


### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/health
Accept: application/json


### ─── LOGIN (usuarios del seed, no requiere register) ───────────

### Login como Admin
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@cursinet.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Login como Instructor
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "instructor@cursinet.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Login como Moderator
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "moderator@cursinet.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Login como Student
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@cursinet.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ─── REGISTER (solo si necesitás usuarios extra) ──────────────

### Register como admin
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "otro-admin@test.com",
  "name": "Otro Admin",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "admin"
}


### Register como instructor
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "otro-instructor@test.com",
  "name": "Otro Instructor",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "instructor"
}


### Register como moderator
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "otro-moderator@test.com",
  "name": "Otro Moderator",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "moderator"
}


### Register como student (default, sin role)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "otro-student@test.com",
  "name": "Otro Student",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ─── REFRESH (requiere cookie refreshToken) ─────────────────────

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "pegar-acá-el-token"
}


### ─── LOGOUT ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{}

